  "body": "One feature synapse seems to be missing is a simple authentication against a foreign database/website. I know there's CAS and SAML support, but those are huge undertaking, while openid connect can easily be implemented and should suffice for most usecases (it's just oauth2 with an entrypoint after authentication).\r\n\r\nhttps://openid.net/connect/",
